{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13287","headline":"和袁郎中破贼後经剡中山水 · 皇甫冉","name":"和袁郎中破贼後经剡中山水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"武库分帷幄，儒衣事鼓鼙。\n兵连越徼外，寇尽海门西。\n节比全疎勒，功当雪会稽。\n旌旗回剡岭，士马濯耶溪。\n受律梅初发，班师草未齐。\n行看佩金印，岂得访丹梯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13287.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13287","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}